
# Mod Kepp Hock

A bright visual preset for Grand Theft Auto V Enhanced.

## Features

- Bright and vibrant colors
- Increased color saturation
- Balanced contrast
- Warm visual atmosphere
- Custom ReShade preset

## Compatibility

- Game: GTA V Enhanced
- Platform: Windows 10 / 11
- Graphics: DirectX 12
- Version: 1.0

## Installation

See [Installation Guide](docs/INSTALL.md).

